      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/hulbert_michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hulbert Lake, once called Be-ne-gah-mah, is a secluded fishing spot that helped shape the community's early days.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
