      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hulbert%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Located just north of M-28 in the Upper Peninsula, Hulbert lies about 40 miles south of Tahquamenon Falls.",
